00:45:15,789 --> 00:45:21,789
Mirrors is a 2008 American supernatural horror film directed by Alexandre
Aja, starring Kiefer Sutherland, Paula Patton, and Amy Smart.

11
00:49:47,368 --> 00:49:53,368
The film was first titled Into the Mirror, but the
name was later changed to Mirrors.

12
00:54:18,947 --> 00:54:24,947
Filming began on May 1, 2007, and it was released in
American theaters on August 15, 2008.

13
00:58:50,526 --> 00:58:56,526
The film was originally scripted as a straightforward remake of
the 2003 South Korean horror film Into the Mirror.

14
01:03:22,105 --> 01:03:28,105
However, once Aja was brought on board and read the script, he was
dissatisfied with the particulars of the original film's story.

15
01:07:53,684 --> 01:07:59,684
He decided to retain the original film's basic idea involving mirrors, and to incorporate a few of
its scenes, but otherwise crafted a new story and script for his version of the movie.

16
01:12:25,263 --> 01:12:31,263
A stand-alone sequel not featuring the original cast and
crew, titled Mirrors 2, was released in 2010.

17
01:16:56,842 --> 01:17:02,842
The film explores themes of affectation, death,
aggressive, cautionary, admiring.

18
01:21:28,421 --> 01:21:34,421
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
